# Normalise line endings in the repository so a checkout on any platform cannot
# commit a whole-file rewrite. A docs file was once converted LF -> CRLF by a
# Windows write, producing 1351 insertions and 1340 deletions for a ten-line
# edit and collapsing 57 commits of `git blame` provenance into one.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets, if any are ever added, must not be touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
